# TrailGo environment variables
#
# Copy this file to .env.local (which is git-ignored) and fill in real
# values. Never commit .env.local or any file containing a real token.

# Required for the Phase 5 interactive map (components/map/AdventureMap.tsx).
# Get a free public token at https://account.mapbox.com/access-tokens/
# after creating a Mapbox account. Mapbox's default "public" token is
# meant to be readable in client-side code (that's what the NEXT_PUBLIC_
# prefix does in Next.js — it's inlined into the browser bundle), but you
# should still restrict it to your domain(s) in the Mapbox dashboard
# before deploying, and keep it out of source control here.
#
# Without this set, the map components render a graceful "Map unavailable"
# state instead of crashing — see AdventureMap.tsx.
NEXT_PUBLIC_MAPBOX_TOKEN=
